    ],
    "text": "PLEASE BE AWARE! The Low Pressure area over East-central Bay of Bengal, is very likely to move West-northwestwards and intensify gradually into a depression over East-central Bay of Bengal on 21st and into a deep depression over West-central Bay of Bengal on 22nd September. Continuing to move west-northwestwards it is very likely to reach West-central and adjoining northwest Bay of Bengal near north Andhra Pradesh - South Odisha coasts around 0000 UTC of 23rd September. The wind speed in the sea areas marked under the \u201cAdvisory\u201d category on the map below will increase to (55-65) kmph at times and those sea areas will be rough or very rough at times.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
